    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mariah van Kessel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105872646259835452007/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9SoutznvAfkbHp3er_DpdTI3JJwR1zpDbfbw34BJ97lY-TcUK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Working with Cristina was an absolute pleasure! From our first meeting, she was friendly, organized, and incredibly knowledgeable. She took the time to truly understand the vision we had for our wedding and worked with us to bring everything together beautifully, all while keeping within our budget and offering great suggestions along the way. Seeing everything come together on the day felt truly magical. Everything was perfect, and we couldn’t recommend her more. Thank you again for your beautiful work!",
        "time": 1762614939,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chloe J",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114981378014312032501/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3Xlo0L4Og19kxoYf_PkvWDJ_sr4dHcRqEoCAHSCfMOkdnlHCT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Cristina is the best florist we could ask for! She provided us with the best suggestions after initial discussion on our vision and delivered it brilliantly!",
        "time": 1764731686,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hunter Barnes-Sinclair",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102096239097073247299/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUM-N4fGGJpKbe6BDmX5ymBDMPGAMiyLJE3gwg_IpIwYmEjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Cristina really brought our vision to life in a way better than I had even hoped for. She was such a great listener and collaborator and went above and beyond to create a dreamy bouquet and boutonnière (x2 so we had a selection between two options to choose from) that surpassed our expectations and made our elopement extra special. I actually got emotional and held back tears as I deconstructed the bouquet to preserve it because it was just so beautiful and sentimental (note: this was after we had driven all over Montreal to find a Canadian Tire with a high quality cooler so that we could keep the bouquet fresh for the week that we were away until we returned home). I said to Cristina that I felt like she captured my soul in flower form. I can’t wait to get all our elopement photos back to see the other shots captured of the bouquet - so far we just have the sneak peeks but I will update this review with more later if that’s an option!",
        "time": 1755823552,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "C T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112507578390799457895/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNQc3nJkilrog90tQBO4JFV6pkzIAX3gkT8ooDGe1myg9RUlY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Truly phenomenal florist to work with for my wedding. Cristina took plenty of notes and really listened to my likes/dislikes and preferences, including accommodating my budget with how she designed the bouquets for my bridesmaids. She went above and beyond to make sure the flowers were perfect for the big day, and they were delivered with the utmost care. I truly cannot recommend her enough!",
        "time": 1728345138,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tanya Massabni",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116878437987747786992/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6IEm1UmNgDKg_mgDezRINnADx_MpZFW8jjn8fzfWW0ZLHTqFA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had the BEST experience with Cristina!!\n\nI had never heard of her before until my photographer mentioned that Cristina's work was like art. So I found her on instagram and scrolled through her many beautiful pictures and knew then and there that I NEEDED her to be my florist, and she  absolutely did not disappoint.\n\nFirst off, she was such a pleasure to work with! So patient and kind, and I know that I could not have been the easiest bride. Up until a month before the wedding, I didn't even know what color palette I wanted or what kind of arch I was going for. But she sat me down (virtually) and discussed each option with me and I never once felt rushed to make a decision. She made me feel supported and listened to and I trusted her 100% to bring my vision to life.\n\nAnd the bouquets....God, the bouquets!!!! I could not believe how stunning my bouquet was. I refused to do the bouquet toss at the end of the night LOL and I would bring it with me everywhere I went. And my bridesmaid bouquets were the prettiest I had ever seen. The pieces she had for the ceremony were repurposed afterwards for the sweeatheart table and it all just looked like such a dream. Everyone was gushing about the gorgeous flowers.\n\nEverything was perfect Cristina and I hope that you get all the recognition you deserve!! I will 100% recommend you to any future bride that I know. Thank you thank you thank you!!!\n\nPS: I will update and post the official pictures once I receive them :)",
        "time": 1675812893,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
